# Force LF for files that run inside Linux containers/shells, regardless of
# a developer's core.autocrlf setting (Windows Git defaults to autocrlf=true,
# which silently rewrites these to CRLF on checkout and breaks `sh` scripts
# like backend/db/seed/entrypoint.sh -- "set -eu\r" is an illegal option to
# `set`, since the trailing \r becomes part of the option string).
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.dockerfile text eol=lf
